<title>USA: West Sacramento Authority, Calif., deal postponed.</title>
<headline>West Sacramento Authority, Calif., deal postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Sacramento Financing Authority, Calif., said Thursday it had postponed for two weeks an $8.9 million lease revenue bond issue, originally slated for sale at 1300 EDT Thursday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
